SYSTEM a certificate import that keeps the file
REPORTS message
RUNS import

PLACE pdf ONE OUTSIDE
    SAYS a certificate PDF the business system made, uploaded by a user
PLACE register MANY LASTING
    SAYS one record for each certificate number
PLACE files MANY LASTING
    SAYS the library of PDFs, one file for each certificate number
PLACE message ONE REPORT

FAULT the pdf cannot be read ABOUT pdf

SEQ import
    keep the file
    record it

ACTION keep the file
    READS pdf
    CREATE files MANY FROM pdf
        LATER STANDS
        BECAUSE the file is the certificate as it was uploaded
    REFUSE WHEN the pdf cannot be read

ACTION record it
    READS pdf
    CREATE register MANY FROM pdf
    ACCEPT WHEN register already has the member
        BECAUSE the record is there already, so the import skips it and says it succeeded
